  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core Support to Indep Asso Broadcasters - Indep Asso Broadcasters Core Support</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Core Support to Indep Asso Broadcasters</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Objective of the intervention: To support systemic organisational improvements in the Independent Association of Broadcaster to establish a healthy and transparent mission-based organisation.
IAB&apos;s Vision for 2015-2018: The institutional capacity of independent audio-visual content producers and distributors has been improved and the regulatory pressure on them has been decreased
IAB&apos;s mission: 1. Protection of freedom of speech --&gt;&#xa0;2. Free media market development&#xa0;--&gt; 3. promoting prosperity of IAB members</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;det till Independent Association of Broadcasters (IAB) kommer att fokusera p&#xe5; att st&#xf6;dja partnerns organisationsutveckling och genomf&#xf6;randet av dess strategi 2015-2018 med f&#xf6;ljande prioriteringar:
&#x2022;f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra lagstiftning f&#xf6;r digital media genom harmonisering av regelramverket till europeiska standarder och f&#xf6;rebyggande av en introduktion av ickedemokratiska normer;
&#x2022;fr&#xe4;mjande av god styrning inom TV- och radioomr&#xe5;det genom offentlig kontroll av regerings- och myndigheters arbete;
&#x2022;s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla pluralism av digital media och andra informationsk&#xe4;llor;  
&#x2022;&#xf6;ka kvalitet av information och journalisters yrkesm&#xe4;ssiga etik f&#xf6;r att s&#xe4;kerst&#xe4;lla medborgarnas r&#xe4;tt till information; 
&#x2022;skapa f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar f&#xf6;r att &#xf6;ka media f&#xf6;r n&#xe5;gra befolkningsgrupper;  
&#x2022;organisationsutveckling av IAB.


Insatsens totala budget &#xe4;r p&#xe5; 4 950 000 SEK, varav 675 000 SEK har anv&#xe4;nts f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rberande st&#xf6;d inf&#xf6;r k&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d. Resten av budgeten skall anv&#xe4;ndas f&#xf6;r implementeringen av IAB strategi 2015-2018.

Core support to the Independent Association of Broadcasters (IAB) will focus on supporting the institutional development of the partner and implementation of its Strategy 2015-2018 including the following priorities:
&#x2022;improving the legislative climate for electronic media operations through approximation of the regulatory framework to the European standards and prevention of introduction of non-democratic norms;
&#x2022;promotion of good governance in the area of TV and radio broadcasting through public control and public assessment of government and administration work;
&#x2022;ensuring external pluralism of electronic media and diverse sources of information;  
&#x2022;enhancing the quality of information and journalists&#x2019; professional standards to ensure citizens&#x2019; right to information access; 
&#x2022;creating conditions for raising media literacy of some population groups;  
&#x2022;organizational development of the Association.

The intervention&apos;s total budget is 4 950 000 SEK, of which 675 000 SEK (includes contingency 32 143 SEK) will be spent from 1 September 2014 to 31 May 2015 for priority improvements (Pre-Core Support). All the rest of the budget will be spent for implementation of IAB strategy.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is one of the core-supported NGOs, funded to improve their       institutional systems and to continue their mission-based activities  over 2014-2017.</narrative>
  </description>
